OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after #200k of cannabis
OL,4,Afound in van
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for more than
OL,7,Fthree years after #200,000 of cannabis
OL,8,Fwas found in the back of a van deemed
OL,9,Fto be overweight.
OL,11,FGjok Ndrevetaj, 33, from
OL,12,FSouthend-on-Sea, was stopped in a white
OL,13,FMercedes Sprinter after police spotted
OL,14,Fthe vehicle travelling southbound on
OL,15,Fthe A1 at Norman Cross on 2 March.
OL,17,FPolice said he told officers the
OL,18,Fvehicle was carrying commercial waste,
OL,19,Fbut officers found eight boxes
OL,20,Fcontaining cannabis as well as remnants
OL,21,Fof a cannabis factory.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,375,370,200,160,0,100
