OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed after #200k of cannabis
OL,4,Afound in van
OL,5,
OL,6,FNdrevetaj was sentenced to three years
OL,7,Fand four months in prison at Huntingdon
OL,8,FCrown Court on Tuesday, having pleaded
OL,9,Fguilty to being concerned in the supply
OL,10,Fof cannabis.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
